,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"38574","synopsis":"This is the story about AI Nonoin Nillon who works for a record company as a composer. One day, Nonoin's manager approaches her with a job to write a song for a major pop idol group. The request was to \"write the song with the group's essence in mind.\" This added note gave Nonoin a lot of trouble as she found herself creatively blocked. \"I finally saw it, but I couldn't make it like I wanted.\" What is the answer she came to after all her worrying?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/72Oj8WbF4rXmXUba0y8bkNRarMa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"This is the story about AI Nonoin Nillon who works for a record company as a composer. One day, Nonoin's manager approaches her with a job to write a song for a major pop idol group. The request was to \"write the song with the group's essence in mind.\" This added note gave Nonoin a lot of trouble as she found herself creatively blocked. \"I finally saw it, but I couldn't make it like I wanted.\" What is the answer she came to after all her worrying?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/72Oj8WbF4rXmXUba0y8bkNRarMa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15092","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"112033","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40940","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"93596","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"375295","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"42674","synopsis":"While police AI Claude was conducting an undercover investigation into an illegally operating bar, he encounters a former colleague, Lanburn, waiting for him. Now Lanburn has turned to a life of crime as a thief AI. As Claude tries to arrest him, Lambern offers a bet instead - a